think Mind's second candidate carried under the attributed-fix shape after the hook wore its own crash as an over-bound verdict; the hook now spells /bin/sh and tells a crash from a measurement. The zero-byte 142844 log -- my own failed restore behind a truncating redirect -- was caught by Mind's audit and rewritten verbatim (%323).
think Three rows booked and closed, folded with the fleet's %321 %322 onto the shells-and-sweeps shelf; the headline recounts to 325 and the spine reads whole.
obs A sweep that takes an uncommitted fix mid-verification manufactures a flake: e134 flipped green-red-green with the fence fix appearing and vanishing under it. Ninth recovery, same lesson finally learned in the muscle: commit before verify, verify on the anointed line.
obs The choir sings 33 true leaves of the 144 the glob finds -- the filter skips leaves that call other witnesses -- and its zero-red verdict now stands on the moved room.
